T*
(Livox MID-360 Documentation Bundle) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Consolidated local documentation for the Livox MID-360 stack in this repository. It) Tj
T*
(combines the repos HTML guides, quick-start notes, Python SDK wrappers, viewer and SLAM) Tj
T*
(entry points, and the sample network configuration.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Primary local sources used for this bundle: docs/lidar_docs.html,) Tj
T*
(docs/lidar_cheatsheet.html, docs/geoff_stack.md, scripts/navigation/slam/livox2_python.py,) Tj
T*
(scripts/navigation/slam/livox_python.py, scripts/sensors/live_points.py,) Tj
T*
(scripts/navigation/slam/live_slam.py, scripts/navigation/slam/mid360_config.json.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. What This Stack Contains) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SDK 2 Wrapper) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(livox2_python.py exposes a minimal push-mode wrapper around Livox-SDK2 and converts packet) Tj
T*
(data into NumPy XYZ arrays.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SDK 1 Wrapper) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(livox_python.py auto-discovers Livox devices on the subnet, connects, starts sampling, and) Tj
T*
(forwards frames to Python callbacks.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Live Viewer) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(live_points.py is the first-line smoke test for streaming point clouds into Open3D.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SLAM Demo) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(live_slam.py feeds Livox scans into KISS-ICP and renders a growing map and pose estimate.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Architecture Overview) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LayerPurposeLocation) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
