(Livox-SDK2 / Livox-SDKDevice discovery, UDP negotiation, packet decoding, Cartesian point) Tj
T*
(conversion.External vendor libraries installed under system library paths.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Python ctypes wrappersLoad the shared libraries and expose point packets as NumPy arrays) Tj
T*
(through handle_points\(\).scripts/navigation/slam/livox2_python.py,) Tj
T*
(scripts/navigation/slam/livox_python.py) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(VisualizationOpen3D windows for live preview and map) Tj
T*
(rendering.scripts/sensors/live_points.py, scripts/navigation/slam/live_slam.py) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Odometry / mappingKISS-ICP registration, pose estimation, and voxel map) Tj
T*
(maintenance.scripts/navigation/slam/live_slam.py) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The broader Geoff architecture also routes Livox MID-360 data over Ethernet/UDP into the) Tj
T*
(laptop-side visualization and control stack. The repo documentation describes this path) Tj
T*
(as:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Livox MID-360 -> livox2_python.py -> network -> lidar_reader / GUI consumers) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Network and Host Requirements) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Connect the G-1 shoulder Ethernet port to the host PC.) Tj
T*
(- Assign the host to the 192.168.123.0/24 subnet, typically 192.168.123.222.) Tj
T*
(- Verify reachability of the LiDAR at 192.168.123.120.) Tj
T*
(- Allow or disable firewall rules that would block Livox UDP traffic.) Tj
T*
(sudo ip addr add 192.168.123.222/24 dev <your_nic>) Tj
T*
(ping 192.168.123.120) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(TrafficPorts Mentioned In Repo Docs) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(MID-360 config ports56100, 56200, 56300, 56400, 56500 plus matching host-side receive) Tj
T*
(ports) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Troubleshooting note from repo docsOpen UDP 55000-56000 and 7500-7510 if packet flow) Tj
T*
(stalls in the SDK path) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. One-Time Installation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recommended: Livox-SDK2) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(git clone https://github.com/Livox-SDK/Livox-SDK2.git) Tj
T*
(cd Livox-SDK2) Tj
T*
(mkdir build) Tj
T*
(cd build) Tj
T*
(cmake .. -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release) Tj
T*
(make -j$\(nproc\)) Tj
T*
(sudo make install) Tj
T*
(sudo ldconfig) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Legacy Fallback: Livox-SDK) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(git clone https://github.com/Livox-SDK/Livox-SDK.git) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
