(7. Running the Local Python Demos) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Live Point Cloud Preview) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(cd scripts/sensors) Tj
T*
(python3 live_points.py) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This script prefers SDK2 and falls back to SDK1 if needed. It keeps a ring buffer of) Tj
T*
(recent frames in Open3D to reduce flicker and applies mount correction if the sensor is) Tj
T*
(upside down.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LiDAR SLAM) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(cd scripts/navigation/slam) Tj
T*
(python3 live_slam.py) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For outdoor tuning:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LIVOX_PRESET=outdoor python3 live_slam.py) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Internal flow documented in the repo:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([ SDK callback thread ] [ main / UI thread ]) Tj
T*
(Livox.handle_points -> KissICP.register_frame -> viewer.push\(\)) Tj
T*
(^ |) Tj
T*
(+-------------- viewer.tick\(\) <-----------+) Tj
