T*
(8. Runtime Controls and Environment Variables) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(VariableEffect) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LIVOX_MOUNT=normal|upside_downControls the 180 degree X-axis correction. Repo defaults to) Tj
T*
(upside_down.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LIVOX_PRESET=indoor|outdoorSelects KISS-ICP and frame aggregation tuning in the SLAM) Tj
T*
(script.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LIDAR_TILT_DEGApplies a fixed inverse tilt correction to compensate for a physically) Tj
T*
(tilted sensor.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LIDAR_TILT_AXIS=x|y|zSelects the tilt compensation axis. Default is y.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LIVOX_SDK2_LIB, LIVOX_SDK2_DIRExplicit SDK2 shared library override paths.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LIVOX_SDK_LIB, LIVOX_SDK_DIRExplicit SDK1 shared library override paths.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9. SLAM Presets) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ParameterIndoorOutdoor) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(frame_time0.35 s0.20 s) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(frame_packets200120) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(voxel_size0.4 m1.0 m) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(max_range30 m120 m) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(downsample_limit5,000,000 points3,000,000 points) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(min_motion0.03 m0.10 m) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(conv_criterion5e-51e-4) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(max_iters800500) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(10. ROS Driver Quick Start) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The repo also carries a ROS Noetic quick-start for livox_ros_driver2:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(source /opt/ros/noetic/setup.bash) Tj
T*
(mkdir -p ~/catkin_ws/src) Tj
T*
(cd ~/catkin_ws/src) Tj
T*
(git clone https://github.com/Livox-SDK/livox_ros_driver2.git) Tj
T*
(cd livox_ros_driver2) Tj
T*
(./build.sh ROS1) Tj
T*
(cd ~/catkin_ws) Tj
T*
(catkin_make -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DROS_EDITION=ROS1) Tj
