() Tj
T*
(Example launch:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(roslaunch livox_ros_driver2 msg_MID360.launch \\) Tj
T*
(user_config_path:=/home/$USER/livox_cfg/MID360_config.json \\) Tj
T*
(xfer_format:=0 data_src:=0) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Verification commands from the local quick-start:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(rostopic hz /livox/lidar) Tj
T*
(sudo tcpdump -i <your_nic> udp port 56300 -n -c 5) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(11. Troubleshooting Checklist) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Only one network interface should sit on 192.168.123.0/24.) Tj
T*
(- If bind or init fails, check the JSON host IP and port ownership.) Tj
T*
(- If frames stall, verify raw UDP arrival with tcpdump.) Tj
T*
(- If SDK libraries are not found, set the appropriate LIVOX_SDK* environment variable or) Tj
T*
(  install the vendor SDK system-wide.) Tj
T*
(- If KISS-ICP import fails, upgrade it with pip install --upgrade kiss-icp.) Tj
T*
(- If the Open3D viewer looks empty or white, zoom out or reset the view.) Tj
T*
(- If point clouds appear inverted, set LIVOX_MOUNT=normal or correct tilt values.) Tj
T*
(- If ROS tools cannot see the topic, confirm the ROS setup files were sourced and the) Tj
T*
(  driver was built for ROS1.) Tj
T*
(12. Relevant Local Files) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
